,"text":"直令南粤还归帝，谁谓匈奴不敢王。\n愿见推财多卜式，未须算赋似桑羊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":71787,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和蒲泰亨四首 其四","author":"黄庭坚","text":"栽竹养松人去尽，空闻道士种桃花。\n昨来一夜惊风雨，满地残红噪暮蛙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":71788,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和蒲泰亨四首 其三","author":"黄庭坚","text":"玉座天开旋北斗，清班鸟散落馀花。\n有人难立百官上，不为庙中羔兔蛙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":71789,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和蒲泰亨四首 其二","author":"黄庭坚","text":"东坡海上无消息，想见惊帆出浪花。\n三十年来世三变，几人能不变鹑蛙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":71790,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和蒲泰亨四首 其一","author":"黄庭坚","text":"我已人间无所用，鬓飘霜雪眼生花。\n东坡兄弟来虽晚，折箭堪除蚀月蛙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":71791,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和裴仲谋雨中自石塘归","author":"黄庭坚","text":"裴友西来咏古风，驱驰万象笔端空。\n尚将物色留分我，远近青山烟雨中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":71792,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏萍","author":"黄庭坚","text":"白发已侵残梦境，绿苔应忆旧渔矶。\n桃源鸡犬尘凡隔，韦曲桑麻念想归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":71793,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜发分宁寄杜涧叟","author":"黄庭坚","text":"阳关一曲水东流，灯火旌阳一钓舟。\n我自只如常日醉，满川风月替人愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":71794,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜闻邻舟崔家儿歌","author":"黄庭坚","text":"半夜闻歌客寝惊，空馀缥缈渡江声。\n湘妃舞罢波纹冷，月欲衔山天未明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":71795,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉同公择作拣芽咏","author":"黄庭坚","text":"赤囊岁上双龙璧，曾见前朝盛事来。\n想得天香随御所，延春阁道转轻雷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":71796,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]